=====================================
EXPLAIN & EXPLAIN ANALYZE
=====================================


1. WHY EXPLAIN IS IMPORTANT

EXPLAIN database ka execution plan dikhata hai.

Matlab database query ko kaise execute karega.

Example

EXPLAIN
SELECT *
FROM users
WHERE id = 10;

Output batata hai

kaunsa index use hua
rows kaise scan ho rahi hain
estimated cost kya hai


-------------------------------------


2. EXPLAIN VS EXPLAIN ANALYZE

EXPLAIN

sirf execution plan estimate karta hai.


EXPLAIN ANALYZE

query actually run karta hai
aur real execution statistics show karta hai.


Example

EXPLAIN ANALYZE
SELECT *
FROM users
WHERE id = 10;


-------------------------------------


3. BASIC EXPLAIN OUTPUT

Typical output columns

id
select_type
table
type
possible_keys
key
rows
Extra


-------------------------------------


4. ACCESS TYPE (MOST IMPORTANT)

Type column batata hai rows kaise access ho rahi hain.

Best → Worst


const

Primary key equality

Example

WHERE id = 10


ref

Index lookup


range

Range scan

Example

price > 100


index

Full index scan


ALL

Full table scan


Important

ALL ka matlab hai database ko efficient index path nahi mila.


-------------------------------------


5. KEY COLUMN

KEY batata hai kaunsa index use hua.

Example

key = idx_users_email


-------------------------------------


6. ROWS ESTIMATE

Rows column batata hai database estimate karta hai
kitni rows scan hongi.


Example

rows = 1000

Matlab database soch raha hai 1000 rows read hongi.


-------------------------------------


7. EXTRA COLUMN

Extra column additional info deta hai.

Common values


Using where

rows filter ho rahi hain.


Using index

covering index use hua hai.


Using temporary

temporary table use hui hai.


Using filesort

sorting ho rahi hai.


-------------------------------------


8. INDEX NOT USED CASE

Example

SELECT *
FROM users
WHERE country = 'India';

Agar 40% rows match karti hain

Database full table scan choose kar sakta hai.


-------------------------------------


9. USING EXPLAIN FOR DEBUGGING

Slow query detect karne ke liye

EXPLAIN ANALYZE use karo.


Example

EXPLAIN ANALYZE
SELECT *
FROM orders
WHERE status = 'pending';


Check karo

index use hua ya nahi
rows kitni scan hui
execution time kya hai


-------------------------------------


10. PRODUCTION INSIGHT

Slow queries fix karne ka best tool

EXPLAIN ANALYZE


Har serious backend engineer ko
execution plans read karna aana chahiye.


